00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:07,305
we have our utility methods for finding

3
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:07,741
edges.

4
00:00:08,499 --> 00:00:10,643
But one thing is missing, or 2 things,

5
00:00:11,061 --> 00:00:13,054
removing nodes and removing edges.

6
00:00:13,907 --> 00:00:16,318
So we want a remove node method

7
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:18,911
which gets the node identifier,

8
00:00:20,721 --> 00:00:23,048
and we want a remove edge method

9
00:00:23,711 --> 00:00:26,542
