16
00:00:39,613 --> 00:00:41,673
Now let's start with removing nodes.

17
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:44,295
When we remove a node,

18
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,839
we of course wanna reach out

19
00:00:49,001 --> 00:00:51,952
