27
00:01:15,154 --> 00:01:18,040
There are various ways of deleting something

28
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,474
I'll use this very simple approach here.

29
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:24,079
Now deleting just a node is not enough

30
00:01:24,224 --> 00:01:26,931
