40
00:01:48,916 --> 00:01:49,590
But that's not all.

41
00:01:50,425 --> 00:01:54,100
Other nodes might have pointed at this node.

42
00:01:54,951 --> 00:01:57,342
So what we'll have to do is we'll have to go

43
00:01:57,342 --> 00:01:59,942
