44
00:02:00,086 --> 00:02:02,573
the other nodes and check whether one of

45
00:02:02,622 --> 00:02:05,558
those nodes points at this node identifier.

46
00:02:06,955 --> 00:02:09,779
And if that's the case, we need to delete

47
00:02:09,779 --> 00:02:10,951
