75
00:03:24,582 --> 00:03:26,906
And after this if block at the end of this

76
00:03:26,922 --> 00:03:28,364
nested loop, we increment i.

77
00:03:29,262 --> 00:03:30,929
If we make it into this if block, we know

78
00:03:30,929 --> 00:03:32,179
that we now have

79
00:03:32,756 --> 00:03:33,221
a match

80
00:03:33,958 --> 00:03:36,362
for the given index, and therefore then we

81
00:03:36,362 --> 00:03:37,789
could reach out to edges

82
00:03:41,513 --> 00:03:42,204
thisEdges,

83
00:03:43,424 --> 00:03:45,351
and here of course it should also be

84
00:03:46,635 --> 00:03:47,743
thisEdges.

85
00:03:48,498 --> 00:03:49,012
So here

86
00:03:49,622 --> 00:03:51,276
and here, that should be thisEdges

87
00:03:51,950 --> 00:03:53,829
for the given edge identifier here.

88
00:03:54,519 --> 00:03:57,554
And we can use splice then to splice this

89
00:03:57,570 --> 00:04:00,845
one object at this index, and thereafter we

90
00:04:00,845 --> 00:04:04,136
can of course break out of this loop of this

91
00:04:04,153 --> 00:04:06,414
inner loop because we don't need to continue

92
00:04:06,478 --> 00:04:09,156
