95
00:04:14,416 --> 00:04:17,110
to-be-deleted node. Since one node can't

96
00:04:17,126 --> 00:04:19,243
have more than one connection to one and the

97
00:04:19,291 --> 00:04:21,809
same node, we don't need to continue looping

98
00:04:21,873 --> 00:04:22,034
here.

99
00:04:22,836 --> 00:04:24,792
And then we continue with the next other

100
00:04:25,017 --> 00:04:26,909
