101
00:04:27,887 --> 00:04:31,257
So that is how we clear all the edges for a

102
00:04:31,257 --> 00:04:32,220
node we wanna remove.

103
00:04:33,264 --> 00:04:34,259
Now let's give this a try.

104
00:04:35,030 --> 00:04:35,784
Let's say here

105
00:04:36,394 --> 00:04:39,060
we actually reach out to our graph and we

106
00:04:39,670 --> 00:04:42,415
